# data.gov.in API key — free, from https://data.gov.in (My Account -> API Key)
# Copy this file to .env.local and paste your key. .env.local is git-ignored.
#
# The scheduled refresh workflows need the same key as a repository secret named
# DATA_GOV_KEY (Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions), or every price and
# sell-timing refresh fails before it starts.
DATA_GOV_KEY=
